{"title": "Looper Insight 9", "parts": {"header": "<div class=\"sd ex-sd\"><div class=sd-grid><div class=sd-head><span class=\"sd-maker none\">LooperRobotics</span><h1 id=\"_top\">Looper Insight 9</h1><p class=sd-type>2 mono + 1 rolling-shutter colour camera + IMU @ 400 Hz</p></div><figure class=sd-plate><div class=sd-frame><img src=\"/media/examples/looper-insight9/looper-insight9.jpg\" alt=\"LooperRobotics Insight 9, front view\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\"></div><figcaption><a href=\"https://looper-robotics.com/home/product/insight-9/\">Photo: LooperRobotics, Insight 9 product page ↗︎</a></figcaption></figure><div class=sd-cta><div class=sd-buttons><a class=\"sd-btn primary\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/calibench-vi/datasets/tree/main/looper-insight9\">Downloads: Calibench, looper-insight9/ ↗︎</a><a class=\"sd-btn\" href=\"/benchmark/results/looper-insight9/\">All 10 recordings and tools: Dataset eval →</a><a class=\"sd-btn\" href=\"/sensors/looper-insight9/\">Looper Insight 9 in the Sensor wiki →</a></div></div><div class=sd-specs><dl class=sd-rows><div class=sd-row><dt>Cameras</dt><dd>2 × 544×640 mono global shutter + 1920×1088 colour rolling shutter</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>IMU</dt><dd>400 Hz</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Board</dt><dd>AprilGrid 6×6, tag 55 mm</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Format</dt><dd>EuRoC mav0</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Licence</dt><dd>CC BY-NC 4.0</dd></div></dl></div></div></div>", "glance": "<p>One MVIS camera + IMU run on hand-held recording 1: the two mono cameras, the rolling-shutter colour camera and its readout time, solved together.</p><div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/hero/hero_looper_960.mp4\" poster=\"/media/hero/hero_looper_960.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>The scene MVIS recovered from this dataset, as on the homepage. The values beside it come from this page&#x27;s run.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.17<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>99.2<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>+1.24<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>43.9<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div><p class=sd-note>Reprojection is how far, in pixels, the detected corners lie from where the solve puts them. td is the camera–IMU time offset, and the lever arm is the camera–IMU position offset.</p>", "process": "<p>MVIS's own player, from this run: the detected board corners, then the rig's path as the solve refines it. Press <b>Play</b> or drag the bar; pick a camera card to look through that camera. We publish no camera images.</p><div class=proc-wrap><button type=button class=proc-open hidden><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"196.2,143.4 287.6,178.1 287.5,58.0 196.1,23.3 196.2,143.4\" fill=\"var(--strong)\" fill-opacity=\".1\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\"/><polyline points=\"174.0,123.0 173.4,121.3 171.5,118.5 167.7,117.4 150.2,108.3 126.3,96.1 127.4,95.6 166.3,115.6 203.6,122.2 208.0,121.1 173.8,119.6 162.9,114.4 168.4,89.1 176.7,47.7 180.2,29.7 170.6,57.3 163.3,109.2 158.1,162.5 156.4,190.8 156.0,186.0 159.7,144.6 167.2,103.2 168.5,92.3 171.5,92.2 189.7,88.8 205.9,89.6 211.7,87.2 191.5,94.4 159.1,108.5 137.1,114.9 138.7,112.7 149.6,108.5 166.0,101.5 177.8,99.5 181.0,100.2 182.1,99.7 184.2,99.3 185.2,98.8 185.2,99.8 184.1,98.2 181.9,95.7 182.1,94.3 181.6,94.7 182.7,95.2 183.5,100.4 185.3,101.4 185.8,101.4 183.6,99.6 178.7,94.5 180.7,92.4 181.6,92.9 181.1,92.7 181.2,97.2 178.5,98.8 178.5,98.9 178.3,100.7 179.0,101.4 180.0,103.3 176.5,107.5 173.2,107.9 169.4,113.3 166.4,119.0 166.9,121.4 168.5,120.0 171.7,113.9 172.3,110.2 172.4,110.5 174.0,109.7 174.4,109.8 173.9,109.7 171.7,107.3 170.6,106.2 170.9,106.2 172.0,106.1 174.1,107.0 174.7,108.2 174.0,108.1 173.2,107.7 174.6,107.6 175.6,107.2 174.9,106.6 171.9,108.1 172.3,107.4 151.9,104.0 117